  "description": "ONAVEG crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P n a 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H87 Dy4 N4 O19 1+,3(C2 H6 O1),2(C1 H4 O1),N1 O3 1-. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.535-5.213 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.25-163.89°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C72H87Dy4N4O19·NO3·3(C2H6O)·2(CH4O) (table C80H113Dy4N5O27). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
